# Criterion 4 - the AppDesignTokens row says AppTheme binds the concrete class

## The row, verbatim from docs/architecture/contracts-map.md

50:| `AppDesignTokens` | **No production consumer** | `DefaultDesignTokens` (`lib/shared/design_system/tokens/default_design_tokens.dart:9`) | Nowhere, and there is no provider. `AppTheme` binds the **concrete** class at compile time: `static const _tokens = DefaultDesignTokens();` (`lib/shared/theme/app_theme.dart:7`). Nothing in `lib/` is typed on `AppDesignTokens`. | Edit `lib/shared/theme/app_theme.dart` to construct your own token class (and update the theme building that reads `_tokens`). There is no override point. |

